<item><title>Congolese bank BGFI RDC finances subcontractor CMD with $45 million</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congolese-bank-bgfi-rdc-finances-subcontractor-cmd-with-45-04143d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/congolese-bank-bgfi-rdc-finances-subcontractor-cmd-with-45-04143d/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The loan to CMD, a Congolese subcontracting firm, is expected to create more than 300 new jobs, according to the bank.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:07:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Opposition coalition backs Catholic leaders over religious restrictions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/opposition-coalition-backs-catholic-leaders-over-religious-f52500/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/opposition-coalition-backs-catholic-leaders-over-religious-f52500/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The Coalition Article 64 condemned a blocked Mass in Kinshasa and restrictions on Lubumbashi’s archbishop before a march over church land.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:06:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>DR Congo presents FDLR disarmament progress at Egypt forum</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-presents-fdlr-disarmament-progress-at-egypt-forum-ebde91/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-presents-fdlr-disarmament-progress-at-egypt-forum-ebde91/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Regional Integration Minister Floribert Anzuluni said two protocols cover disarmament, demobilisation and cantonment of FDLR fighters and affiliates.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:47:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tshisekedi sets four demands for Congo to process more minerals at home</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/tshisekedi-sets-four-demands-for-congo-to-process-more-84a45e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/tshisekedi-sets-four-demands-for-congo-to-process-more-84a45e/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>At a Kinshasa economic forum, the president said reliable energy, infrastructure, skills and a fight against misconduct are needed for the shift.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:54:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>DR Congo health workers extend public-hospital strike</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-health-workers-extend-public-hospital-strike-b5fc3e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-health-workers-extend-public-hospital-strike-b5fc3e/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The inter-union group decided in Kinshasa to continue the stoppage until its demands are met, after eight weeks of strike action.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:21:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-health-workers-extend-public-hospital-strike-b5fc3e/share.jpg" length="39868" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/dr-congo-health-workers-extend-public-hospital-strike-b5fc3e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
